That's exactly right.

51:40.435 --> 51:41.687
I was wrong.

51:42.312 --> 51:45.480
And I really, really
want to come back to camp.

51:45.481 --> 51:46.566
Hmm.

51:46.567 --> 51:49.194
And learn from you,
if you would have me, of course.

51:56.785 --> 52:00.330
Really? Well, I think
we could discuss that.

52:01.081 --> 52:02.582
- Okay.
- Would you like to sit down?

52:02.583 --> 52:04.584
- I would love to.
- Before you fall down.

52:08.755 --> 52:10.297
I was just thinking,
you know...

52:10.298 --> 52:11.675
Mm-hmm?

52:12.217 --> 52:15.595
I want to help.
As much as I can, I mean.

52:15.596 --> 52:17.680
I learned the hard way. You
make all this look really easy.

52:17.681 --> 52:19.807
But, I think
that's the best bet.

52:19.808 --> 52:21.391
Working as a team.

52:21.392 --> 52:24.019
You know?
That's a smart, smart play.

52:24.020 --> 52:24.979
That is smart.

52:24.980 --> 52:26.480
- Yes.
- Yes.

52:26.481 --> 52:29.441
Definitely smart on your part.

52:29.442 --> 52:31.987
"Linda."

52:34.573 --> 52:35.574
So, what do you think?

52:35.949 --> 52:36.783
About what?

52:37.200 --> 52:38.951
Could you overlook
some of my character flaws?

52:38.952 --> 52:40.244
Of which there are many.

52:40.245 --> 52:42.330
And...

52:44.374 --> 52:46.585
...maybe I can join you
for lunch.

52:48.211 --> 52:50.963
Mmm. I don't know.

52:50.964 --> 52:52.132
Can I trust ya?

52:54.217 --> 52:56.678
You can.

53:01.224 --> 53:02.517
There was a little more on that.

53:04.853 --> 53:05.979
Linda, please.

53:06.312 --> 53:07.939
Please. Please.

53:09.440 --> 53:12.235
I'm sorry.

53:13.945 --> 53:14.905
So, is that it?

53:17.115 --> 53:18.324
- Was that it?
- Is that your pitch?

53:21.828 --> 53:23.955
What do you want from me? Huh?

53:25.040 --> 53:26.124
Well, that depends.

53:28.084 --> 53:32.213
How above and beyond
are you willing to go for me?

53:38.261 --> 53:39.638
Hmm.

53:57.113 --> 53:59.825
Oh, I'm kidding, I'm kidding.
Just keep your shirt on.

54:00.200 --> 54:02.077
I would never do that.

54:04.329 --> 54:05.664
I'm not like you.

54:09.626 --> 54:11.294
Enough.

54:12.378 --> 54:14.089
Eat.

54:15.256 --> 54:16.882
Enjoy.

54:16.883 --> 54:18.467
Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.

54:18.468 --> 54:20.344
- Here's some sauce.
- Thank you. Thank you.

54:20.345 --> 54:21.846
And I will get you
some more water.

54:21.847 --> 54:23.472
Thank you.

54:23.473 --> 54:25.767
- Mr. Bossypants.
- Oh, my God.

54:26.643 --> 54:30.229
What is that?

54:30.230 --> 54:32.523
Mmm.

54:34.525 --> 54:36.152
Mmm.

54:37.070 --> 54:37.904
Fuck.

54:39.155 --> 54:40.616
Ooh, mama.

54:48.539 --> 54:50.792
Ah, what do you say
we take a walk?

54:51.501 --> 54:52.334
Sure.

54:52.335 --> 54:53.335
Your leg's getting
so much better.

54:53.336 --> 54:54.795
We should keep rehabbing it.

54:54.796 --> 54:55.881
Where are we going?

54:56.673 --> 54:57.549
Surprise.

54:59.760 --> 55:01.385
- You okay?
- Yeah.

55:22.240 --> 55:23.825
Okay, this spot's tough.

55:26.411 --> 55:28.038
This is the tricky bit.

55:33.334 --> 55:35.170
You got it?

55:38.339 --> 55:39.840
You got it.

55:39.841 --> 55:41.968
There we go.

55:42.803 --> 55:45.429
- Yeah.
- Fun, right?

55:47.015 --> 55:48.224
Sure.

55:58.443 --> 55:59.986
Nothing for days.

56:02.906 --> 56:04.365
That's us down there.

56:05.867 --> 56:06.827
This way.

56:14.710 --> 56:16.211
Little foraging tip.

56:17.420 --> 56:20.506
So, you never want to
eat a berry

56:21.382 --> 56:23.301
that's yellow, green, or white.

56:23.635 --> 56:25.971
But if you really wanna know
if it's poisonous or not...

56:33.269 --> 56:36.105
If there's a reaction,
like that?

56:36.106 --> 56:38.817
Yeah, yeah. Don't spread it
on your morning scone, got it.

56:39.568 --> 56:41.401
Funny.

56:41.402 --> 56:43.487
All right, now down there,

56:43.488 --> 56:45.865
you see that rock
that kinda looks like an X?

56:45.866 --> 56:46.783
Yeah.

56:47.075 --> 56:48.868
So, that part of the island,

56:48.869 --> 56:51.705
it's all thorn bushes
and poison vines.

56:52.372 --> 56:53.623
Three steps into that,

56:53.624 --> 56:56.042
and you'll be scratching
your skin off for a week, so...

56:57.252 --> 56:59.045
you don't want to
go that way, ever.

57:00.338 --> 57:02.090
Okay.

57:02.924 --> 57:04.091
All right. We should head back.

57:04.092 --> 57:05.010
Yeah.

57:06.219 --> 57:07.303
Limpy McGee.

57:11.850 --> 57:14.978
I might give, uh, my leg
a breather for a minute.

57:16.605 --> 57:17.773
Yep.

57:18.690 --> 57:19.775
Take your time.

57:21.860 --> 57:23.277
Big trek down--

57:23.278 --> 57:24.444
Oh, shit!

57:28.241 --> 57:30.450
Oh, shit! Shit, here!

57:30.451 --> 57:32.954
Here. Grab on.

57:33.496 --> 57:34.371
Grab my hand.

57:34.372 --> 57:36.248
Over here, grab on.

57:50.722 --> 57:51.557
Are you okay?

57:52.558 --> 57:53.391
Thank you.

57:54.350 --> 57:55.351
I owed you one.

58:02.400 --> 58:03.652
Look what I found.

58:04.110 --> 58:05.236
Green bananas?

58:05.571 --> 58:06.822
Not for long.

58:09.866 --> 58:12.578
Gonna give Mother Nature
a little kick start.

58:15.914 --> 58:18.291
The heat turns the starch
to sugar.

58:19.835 --> 58:21.502
Try one now.

58:29.970 --> 58:31.136
Oh, my God.

58:31.137 --> 58:33.138
- Yeah?
- Oh, it's incredible.

58:33.139 --> 58:35.809
- Mmm.
- It's unbelievable. It's like...

58:36.351 --> 58:38.060
It's crispy, it's creamy.

58:38.061 --> 58:39.980
But, this is nothing.

58:41.189 --> 58:42.357
You ever heard of pruno?

58:42.858 --> 58:44.066
Pruno? What's that?

58:44.067 --> 58:47.027
It's what people in prison
drink to get intoxicated.

58:47.028 --> 58:48.112
Mmm.

58:48.113 --> 58:49.405
Mostly fermented fruit.

58:50.365 --> 58:51.907
It's otherwise known
as "toilet wine."

58:51.908 --> 58:52.909
Toilet wine.

58:53.952 --> 58:55.453
So, what?
You want to make toilet wine?

58:56.580 --> 58:57.748
Already did.

58:58.707 --> 59:00.416
Been working on it
for a few days.

59:01.501 --> 59:02.544
Wanna get drunk?

59:02.919 --> 59:03.962
Fuck yeah.

59:04.420 --> 59:05.547
All right.

59:12.554 --> 59:14.054
It's so good.

59:14.055 --> 59:15.306
Thank you, Sweetie.

59:15.724 --> 59:16.808
Just call me sweetie?

59:17.768 --> 59:18.602
I...

59:19.310 --> 59:21.772
Yes, but...
Sorry, Sweetie's my bird.

59:22.355 --> 59:23.774
Oh, you have a bird.

59:24.274 --> 59:25.776
- Yeah, I miss her.
- Yeah, I bet.

59:26.484 --> 59:28.068
Great little bird.

59:28.069 --> 59:30.487
So, you live alone with a bird?

59:30.488 --> 59:31.740
Sorry.

59:32.115 --> 59:32.949
Sorry.

59:35.702 --> 59:36.703
I was married.

59:37.663 --> 59:38.996
- Really?
- Mm-hmm.

59:38.997 --> 59:39.915
Wow.

59:41.374 --> 59:42.207
- Yes.
- Not like that.

59:42.208 --> 59:43.668
I just meant, didn't know.

59:43.669 --> 59:44.753
Thanks.

59:45.045 --> 59:46.254
Yeah, ten years.

59:48.632 --> 59:50.216
- Yeah.
- So divorced or...?

59:50.842 --> 59:51.677
No, he died.

59:53.261 --> 59:54.303
Oh, I'm sorry.

59:54.304 --> 59:56.598
No, no. Don't be.
He was not very nice.

59:58.224 --> 59:59.099
Yeah. I just...

59:59.100 --> 01:00:01.394
I don't think
he knew how to love.

01:00:02.062 --> 01:00:02.896
Yeah.

01:00:03.647 --> 01:00:05.898
Yeah, I know how that feels.

01:00:05.899 --> 01:00:07.025
Oh, yeah?

01:00:07.859 --> 01:00:08.694
Yeah.

01:00:09.820 --> 01:00:11.321
Yeah, my parents, uh...

01:00:11.905 --> 01:00:12.864
...were the same.

01:00:13.364 --> 01:00:14.908
Both with each other and me.

01:00:15.701 --> 01:00:17.118
Dad was a total stranger.

01:00:18.328 --> 01:00:20.581
I didn't know him. Couldn't
tell you one thing about him.

01:00:21.915 --> 01:00:23.499
Was raised by my mom.

01:00:24.668 --> 01:00:26.127
Very mean person.

01:00:27.588 --> 01:00:29.380
Uh, like, abusive.

01:00:29.840 --> 01:00:31.675
Emotionally, physically.

01:00:34.553 --> 01:00:36.511
Yeah. Her father was
a piece of shit though,

01:00:36.512 --> 01:00:38.931
so, I try not to blame her, but,

01:00:38.932 --> 01:00:42.811
it's hard to not resent her,
you know?

01:00:48.650 --> 01:00:50.735
You ever hear that saying, uh,

01:00:50.736 --> 01:00:53.238
"monsters aren't born,
they're created"?

01:00:56.199 --> 01:00:58.534
Yeah. What?
Are you calling me a monster?

01:00:59.745 --> 01:01:01.246
Oh, yeah.
You're a monster, all right.

01:01:01.788 --> 01:01:04.666
Yeah. Yeah, I am.

01:01:05.416 --> 01:01:06.251
I am.

01:01:07.043 --> 01:01:08.461
At least now we know...

01:01:09.838 --> 01:01:13.049
...it's not your fault.

01:01:18.722 --> 01:01:21.141
Did you ever think about
leaving him? Your husband?

01:01:23.810 --> 01:01:24.645
Yeah.

01:01:26.104 --> 01:01:27.022
Every night.

01:01:28.815 --> 01:01:29.858
For years.

01:01:32.903 --> 01:01:36.364
I just kept hoping
he'd change, and...

01:01:37.282 --> 01:01:40.952
...just go back to how it was
in the beginning.

01:01:41.953 --> 01:01:43.954
You know, you just,
you lie to yourself,

01:01:43.955 --> 01:01:46.958
because you don't
want to be alone.

01:01:52.673 --> 01:01:53.799
How'd he die?

01:01:57.052 --> 01:01:58.178
Car accident.

01:02:02.057 --> 01:02:03.308
He was a drinker.

01:02:05.936 --> 01:02:07.312
And, uh...

01:02:08.772 --> 01:02:11.608
...I'd always hide his keys when
he got really, really drunk.

01:02:13.735 --> 01:02:16.655
And one night...
well, that night...

01:02:17.656 --> 01:02:18.990
we had a big fight.

01:02:21.159 --> 01:02:23.411
And he did some things
he shouldn't have.

01:02:25.997 --> 01:02:27.290
Awful things.

01:02:30.085 --> 01:02:31.252
Even for him.

01:02:34.380 --> 01:02:37.050
And he had
this full head of steam.

01:02:38.051 --> 01:02:40.178
He was looking for those keys.

01:02:43.807 --> 01:02:45.475
So, I took them out of my purse.

01:02:47.894 --> 01:02:49.020
Put them on the table.

01:02:51.773 --> 01:02:52.733
Let him go.

01:02:55.193 --> 01:02:56.820
Poured him his last drink.

01:03:06.622 --> 01:03:08.581
Can't believe I told you that.

01:03:08.582 --> 01:03:09.499
It's okay.

01:03:11.918 --> 01:03:13.419
I've never told anyone that.

01:03:23.346 --> 01:03:24.180
You know what?

01:03:25.098 --> 01:03:26.808
I don't think
we should ever leave here.

01:03:29.603 --> 01:03:30.646
You know what I mean?

01:04:02.844 --> 01:04:05.889
Oh, God.

01:05:02.779 --> 01:05:05.115
Here, cover the fire!

01:05:10.495 --> 01:05:12.830
Uh, we gotta get off this beach!

01:05:19.630 --> 01:05:21.005
- Are you okay?
- Yeah.

01:05:21.006 --> 01:05:22.007
We gotta go!

01:05:24.009 --> 01:05:25.886
Come on!

01:05:29.973 --> 01:05:31.516
Oh.

01:05:32.475 --> 01:05:33.685
In here!

01:05:34.477 --> 01:05:36.938
Ready? Okay. Watch your step.

01:05:37.522 --> 01:05:39.690
It gets real low here
so, careful.

01:05:46.657 --> 01:05:48.867
Okay.
This'll be good till it passes.

01:05:51.036 --> 01:05:52.452
It's fucking freezing.

01:05:52.453 --> 01:05:54.080
Take that off. Take it off.

01:05:55.040 --> 01:05:55.874
It'll help.

01:05:58.877 --> 01:06:01.588
Okay. Okay. Okay.

01:06:12.390 --> 01:06:14.392
Here. Come here.

01:06:15.351 --> 01:06:16.978
Body heat, right?

01:06:17.270 --> 01:06:19.314
Yeah, that's smart. Okay.

01:06:23.026 --> 01:06:25.403
- Okay.
- Yeah, that's better.

01:06:35.413 --> 01:06:38.499
Okay.

01:06:46.925 --> 01:06:47.884
Bradley?

01:06:53.974 --> 01:06:55.308
Bradley!

01:06:58.228 --> 01:06:59.062
Bradley?

01:07:01.732 --> 01:07:02.566
Yeah.

01:07:07.654 --> 01:07:08.739
You got up early.

01:07:10.281 --> 01:07:11.658
Yeah, uh...

01:07:12.242 --> 01:07:13.159
Couldn't sleep.

01:07:14.285 --> 01:07:16.954
I went to camp,
and, uh, it's all gone.

01:07:16.955 --> 01:07:18.748
All washed away.

01:07:18.749 --> 01:07:21.584
Probably pretty stupid of me
to build so close to shore.

01:07:21.585 --> 01:07:22.502
No, it's okay.

01:07:23.086 --> 01:07:24.045
Build a new one.

01:07:26.089 --> 01:07:26.922
Yeah.

01:07:26.923 --> 01:07:28.634
Do it on higher ground
this time, right?

01:07:29.175 --> 01:07:30.175
Yeah.

01:07:30.176 --> 01:07:31.177
And I can help.

01:07:31.595 --> 01:07:33.972
I mean, getting stronger.

01:07:35.306 --> 01:07:36.391
Could do it together.

01:07:39.435 --> 01:07:40.478
I'd like that.

01:08:14.805 --> 01:08:15.888
You know, this would be
a lot easier

01:08:15.889 --> 01:08:17.140
if I could use that knife.

01:08:19.100 --> 01:08:20.185
Yeah.

01:08:20.644 --> 01:08:22.771
But you should really
learn to do it without.

01:08:24.147 --> 01:08:26.398
Take a crack at it, solve it.

01:08:26.399 --> 01:08:27.358
Prove me wrong.

01:08:27.693 --> 01:08:29.360
Didn't you say that to me once?

01:08:29.695 --> 01:08:32.072
Ah. Very good.

01:08:36.201 --> 01:08:37.035
All right.

01:08:38.411 --> 01:08:40.956
Leg's getting a little stiff.
I'm gonna take it for a walk.

01:08:41.539 --> 01:08:43.208
I think I'm gonna try to
get to the high ridge today.

01:08:44.542 --> 01:08:46.836
That's pretty far.

01:08:46.837 --> 01:08:49.254
Watch out for those poison vines
on the south side, remember?

01:08:49.255 --> 01:08:50.173
Yup.

01:08:50.716 --> 01:08:51.550
You know what?

01:08:52.008 --> 01:08:52.926
I'll join you.

01:08:54.678 --> 01:08:55.511
Sure.

01:08:55.971 --> 01:08:57.681
Need some exercise myself.

01:08:58.724 --> 01:09:00.516
Hey, I wanted
to thank you, by the way.

01:09:00.934 --> 01:09:01.768
For?

01:09:02.227 --> 01:09:04.270
Just all the things
you've taught me out here.

01:09:05.063 --> 01:09:06.438
Just in case, you know,

01:09:06.439 --> 01:09:09.275
they find us soon,
or this comes to an end.

01:09:10.151 --> 01:09:12.862
Wanted you to know
the time here, for me,

01:09:12.863 --> 01:09:14.740
it wasn't wasted.

01:09:16.575 --> 01:09:18.284
Yeah. I feel the same way.

01:09:25.876 --> 01:09:27.002
Can I make you dinner?

01:09:28.128 --> 01:09:29.045
Tomorrow night?

01:09:30.296 --> 01:09:31.672
Get you outta the kitchen
for a change?

01:09:31.673 --> 01:09:32.673
What do you think?

01:09:32.674 --> 01:09:34.926
Well, that would be nice.

01:09:46.437 --> 01:09:49.023
Good evening, madam. Thank you
for dining with us tonight.

01:09:49.024 --> 01:09:51.358
Oh, my goodness. Look at that!

01:09:51.359 --> 01:09:53.152
For starters,
we have a mango salsa,

01:09:53.153 --> 01:09:55.781
accompanied by Marian plums,
freshly picked.

01:09:56.657 --> 01:09:58.032
And for the main course,
we have a beautiful white fish.

01:09:58.033 --> 01:10:01.745
A smoked barramundi
with a wild lemon grass garnish.

01:10:04.748 --> 01:10:06.749
W-Wonderful.

01:10:06.750 --> 01:10:08.043
Bon appétit.

01:10:08.627 --> 01:10:11.253
Uh, do you,
do you cook much at home or...?

01:10:11.254 --> 01:10:13.255
No. No. Never.

01:10:13.256 --> 01:10:17.301
We either order out
or go to dinner.

01:10:17.302 --> 01:10:19.804
Occasionally, we'll have
like a chef come and cook for us

01:10:19.805 --> 01:10:21.682
- if we wanna get fancy.
- Wow. Mmm.

01:10:22.265 --> 01:10:25.644
That's you and your fiancée,
Zuri?

01:10:27.312 --> 01:10:28.229
Zuri, yeah.

01:10:29.898 --> 01:10:31.274
You must miss her, huh?

01:10:32.734 --> 01:10:33.569
Yeah.

01:10:43.829 --> 01:10:44.663
You okay?

01:10:47.207 --> 01:10:49.334
Feeling a little, uh...

01:10:51.962 --> 01:10:54.297
...dizzy, actually.

01:10:54.756 --> 01:10:56.299
Maybe you should lay down.

01:10:57.050 --> 01:10:59.761
Yeah.

01:11:16.194 --> 01:11:18.863
What?

01:11:31.627 --> 01:11:35.881
No!

01:12:02.908 --> 01:12:04.283
Yes!

01:12:04.284 --> 01:12:05.618
Fuck you, Linda!

01:12:15.879 --> 01:12:17.005
No, no, no, no!

01:12:18.214 --> 01:12:19.841
Fuck!

01:12:59.130 --> 01:13:00.422
Aw...

01:13:00.423 --> 01:13:02.133
baby.

01:13:42.924 --> 01:13:45.552
I really was just trying
to knock you out. I wasn't...

01:13:46.386 --> 01:13:48.263
I swear to God, you know...

01:13:49.222 --> 01:13:50.472
I wasn't trying to...

01:13:50.473 --> 01:13:52.224
- Just stop.
- It was just...

01:13:52.225 --> 01:13:55.394
You don't have to keep
saying that. I-I believe you.

01:13:55.395 --> 01:13:56.396
Mmm.

01:14:03.654 --> 01:14:06.489
I tasted something
bitter, but I just...

01:14:07.532 --> 01:14:08.908
I really didn't want to think

01:14:08.909 --> 01:14:10.493
you could
do something like that.

01:14:11.536 --> 01:14:12.412
But...

01:14:13.872 --> 01:14:14.997
Anyway, you know what,

01:14:14.998 --> 01:14:17.291
it would take a hell of a lot
more berries than that to...

01:14:17.292 --> 01:14:18.627
kill a human being.

01:14:19.169 --> 01:14:20.003
Yeah.

01:14:20.295 --> 01:14:21.211
For next time.

01:14:21.212 --> 01:14:24.298
I even screwed that up.

01:14:24.299 --> 01:14:25.507
Such an idiot.

01:14:31.181 --> 01:14:32.098
It's okay.

01:14:32.473 --> 01:14:34.058
I get it.

01:14:34.059 --> 01:14:35.686
Here, here, here.

01:14:36.227 --> 01:14:38.396
Come on, let's get
your strength back, huh?

01:14:39.314 --> 01:14:40.231
Again.

01:14:40.857 --> 01:14:41.775
Okay.

01:14:43.819 --> 01:14:45.278
- There you go.
- Mmm.

01:14:45.696 --> 01:14:46.529
Yeah.

01:14:49.449 --> 01:14:52.911
Now, some things are gonna
have to change with you.

01:14:53.829 --> 01:14:56.205
- And it's not gonna be easy.
- Definitely.

01:14:56.206 --> 01:14:57.498
Yeah.

01:14:58.291 --> 01:15:00.918
I've really been thinking

01:15:00.919 --> 01:15:03.171
how I can get through to you.

01:15:03.755 --> 01:15:05.881
Do you want some?
You haven't eaten.

01:15:05.882 --> 01:15:07.216
I'm okay, thanks.

01:15:07.217 --> 01:15:08.677
- You sure?
- Yeah.

01:15:09.135 --> 01:15:10.596
Still have a queasy tummy.

01:15:11.597 --> 01:15:12.598
Right.

01:15:14.057 --> 01:15:15.182
- I know how hard...
- So stupid.

01:15:15.183 --> 01:15:16.560
...this all must be for you.

01:15:17.811 --> 01:15:19.605
Not being in control.

01:15:20.355 --> 01:15:22.272
- Ahh.
- You're not used to...

01:15:22.273 --> 01:15:24.484
being in this, shall we say,

01:15:25.526 --> 01:15:27.277
...submissive position.

01:15:29.280 --> 01:15:30.280
I mean, it's natural

01:15:30.281 --> 01:15:32.074
for you not to be able
to take orders from me.

01:15:32.075 --> 01:15:35.703
To have to depend on me
for your survival.

01:15:35.704 --> 01:15:37.122
You know?

01:15:37.873 --> 01:15:38.832
It's just natural.

01:15:39.499 --> 01:15:41.500
You're a slave to your biology.

01:15:41.501 --> 01:15:43.587
Oh!

01:15:44.713 --> 01:15:46.506
Feeling kinda funny, huh?

01:15:47.298 --> 01:15:48.884
Can't move?

01:15:49.384 --> 01:15:53.138
That's the neurotoxins
from this blue-ringed octopus.

01:15:54.347 --> 01:15:58.018
Blocks the transmission
of nerve impulses.

01:15:59.477 --> 01:16:01.104
Caught it about a week ago.

01:16:02.105 --> 01:16:05.108
Was really hoping I wouldn't
have to use it, but...

01:16:05.734 --> 01:16:07.110
...held on to it.

01:16:08.361 --> 01:16:09.696
Just in case.

01:16:13.241 --> 01:16:16.285
Now, you did a great job
with that raft. I gotta say.

01:16:16.286 --> 01:16:17.746
You really are a quick study.

01:16:19.164 --> 01:16:21.667
But if you really wanted it
to hold...

01:16:23.084 --> 01:16:26.547
...you should have used
double floor lashing.

01:16:27.881 --> 01:16:29.633
But, of course,
I never taught you that one.

01:16:30.216 --> 01:16:31.092
Shoot.

01:16:33.804 --> 01:16:37.390
Now, I just want to put
your mind at ease, okay?

01:16:38.224 --> 01:16:41.519
The toxins from
the Hapalochlaena lunulata

01:16:42.145 --> 01:16:43.438
aren't gonna kill you.

01:16:44.439 --> 01:16:46.941
And I promise
they will wear off.

01:16:46.942 --> 01:16:49.444
But right now, you won't be able
to move or feel anything.

01:16:50.153 --> 01:16:52.196
And trust me...

01:16:52.197 --> 01:16:53.824
...I think you want it that way.

01:16:54.950 --> 01:16:56.159
Ooh.

01:17:06.962 --> 01:17:08.213
Where was I?

01:17:08.922 --> 01:17:13.884
So, when I was a little girl,
we had this dog.

01:17:15.470 --> 01:17:18.639
Very, very naughty dog.
So disobedient.

01:17:18.640 --> 01:17:21.685
Always running away.

01:17:24.354 --> 01:17:28.357
And my dad said,
"It's not his fault.

01:17:28.358 --> 01:17:30.860
He just..."

01:17:33.279 --> 01:17:36.032
"...needs to be fixed."

01:17:41.913 --> 01:17:42.956
Now...

01:17:44.207 --> 01:17:46.793
it's actually quite a simple...

01:17:48.044 --> 01:17:49.295
...medical procedure.

01:17:49.671 --> 01:17:52.883
They used to do it
all the time to Egyptian slaves.

01:17:53.466 --> 01:17:56.261
Made them more, um, obedient.

01:17:56.970 --> 01:17:58.805
Compliant.

01:18:01.558 --> 01:18:02.559
Okay.

01:18:05.395 --> 01:18:06.855
No help is coming.

01:18:08.481 --> 01:18:10.567
This is the way things are now.

01:18:10.984 --> 01:18:13.194
And you need
to just accept that.

01:18:14.655 --> 01:18:16.239
You are stuck.

01:18:17.115 --> 01:18:18.199
No power.

01:18:18.659 --> 01:18:20.577
Low end of the totem pole.

01:18:21.870 --> 01:18:23.955
With some asshole boss.

01:18:24.706 --> 01:18:26.166
Just like I was.

01:18:27.167 --> 01:18:28.876
Although, I'm betting...

01:18:28.877 --> 01:18:32.213
I am a much nicer boss
than you ever would have been.

01:18:34.465 --> 01:18:37.636
Except for maybe this part.

01:18:40.388 --> 01:18:41.347
Ready?

01:18:48.188 --> 01:18:49.564
Okay.

01:18:49.565 --> 01:18:51.148
Now, now, don't be a baby.

01:18:51.149 --> 01:18:52.734
You're not gonna miss
this stuff.

01:19:01.534 --> 01:19:03.368
Ooh!

01:19:05.664 --> 01:19:07.539
We got a bleeder here.

01:19:07.540 --> 01:19:09.667
A lot of blood.

01:19:09.668 --> 01:19:11.335
Wow.

01:19:15.591 --> 01:19:16.800
Oh.

01:19:23.098 --> 01:19:25.183
It's okay. It's just a rat.

01:19:30.521 --> 01:19:32.482
Next time it won't be a rat.

01:19:34.693 --> 01:19:38.488
So, don't ever mistake
my kindness for weakness.

01:19:53.503 --> 01:19:54.671
Hey, there!

01:19:55.756 --> 01:19:57.090
How goes it?

01:20:00.552 --> 01:20:02.888
Barely talked in two days,
you Gloomy Gus.

01:20:07.017 --> 01:20:09.310
Would it kill you
to give me a little smile?

01:20:17.819 --> 01:20:19.821
Mmm. There it is.

01:20:20.989 --> 01:20:22.866
Tell you what I'm gonna do
to cheer you up.

01:20:23.700 --> 01:20:25.160
I'm gonna go find...

01:20:26.077 --> 01:20:29.371
the juiciest, most beautiful
fruits on this whole island

01:20:29.372 --> 01:20:30.957
and make you a little treat.

01:20:36.504 --> 01:20:38.380
Such a sourpuss.

01:20:38.381 --> 01:20:41.383
Make him a little fire,
and he's gonna come around.

01:20:54.773 --> 01:20:57.066
Hello? Hello?

01:20:57.067 --> 01:20:58.193
Shit.

01:21:00.571 --> 01:21:02.738
Linda! It's me.

01:21:02.739 --> 01:21:05.741
Shit, shit,
shit, shit, shit, shit...

01:21:05.742 --> 01:21:09.787
Oh, my God! We found her!
I did it. I can't believe it.

01:21:09.788 --> 01:21:11.039
Hey.

01:21:12.373 --> 01:21:13.666
- Hey.
- No, no, no.

01:21:14.668 --> 01:21:16.544
Come here!

01:21:16.545 --> 01:21:17.878
Oh, my God.

01:21:17.879 --> 01:21:20.006
Hi. Hello.

01:21:21.382 --> 01:21:23.342
Is he alive? Is he here?

01:21:23.343 --> 01:21:24.343
How on earth?

01:21:24.344 --> 01:21:26.637
Bradley, is he-- is he here?

01:21:26.638 --> 01:21:27.680
- Yes.
- He is?

01:21:27.681 --> 01:21:29.348
- Yes, he's here.
- Oh, my God.

01:21:29.349 --> 01:21:31.017
- He is here.
- He's alive!

01:21:32.060 --> 01:21:33.936
Even when they called off
the search in this area,

01:21:33.937 --> 01:21:35.395
I never gave up.

01:21:35.396 --> 01:21:37.732
- I couldn't give up.
- That's amazing.

01:21:37.733 --> 01:21:40.067
I hired my own boat,
I did my own search.

01:21:40.068 --> 01:21:42.361
Is he okay? Is he hurt? Is he...

01:21:42.362 --> 01:21:43.655
He's fine.

01:21:44.530 --> 01:21:47.366
- He's so good. He's great.
- Great.

01:21:47.367 --> 01:21:49.201
I can't believe
this is happening.

01:21:49.202 --> 01:21:51.036
I know.

01:21:51.037 --> 01:21:52.955
Please, can you take me to him?
Right now?

01:21:52.956 --> 01:21:55.082
- I need to see him. Please.
- He's, um...

01:21:55.083 --> 01:21:56.083
Is he just down here?

01:21:56.084 --> 01:21:57.209
- Yes, he's out here.
- Yeah? He is?

01:21:57.210 --> 01:21:58.586
No, no, no.

01:21:58.587 --> 01:21:59.879
- He's not over there.
- Bradley, I'm here!

01:21:59.880 --> 01:22:01.756
- Um--
- Bradley, where are you?

01:22:01.757 --> 01:22:03.216
Should we follow you?

01:22:04.300 --> 01:22:05.385
This way?

01:22:08.013 --> 01:22:09.430
Should we follow you?

01:22:09.723 --> 01:22:10.849
Uh...

01:22:11.432 --> 01:22:14.309
- I just need to get my stuff.
- You're not gonna need this.

01:22:14.310 --> 01:22:15.645
Ow.

01:22:15.646 --> 01:22:18.398
- Sorry. Sorry, I just...
- You like mango, right?

01:22:18.940 --> 01:22:19.857
Yeah, I worked really hard.

01:22:19.858 --> 01:22:21.777
We got lots of food on the boat.

01:22:23.904 --> 01:22:24.863
Oh, yum.

01:22:25.906 --> 01:22:26.907
Yum, yum, yum.

01:22:27.448 --> 01:22:28.575
Lead the way.

01:22:29.242 --> 01:22:32.287
So, is it just the two of you?

01:22:33.163 --> 01:22:35.581
Or is there a whole search party
waiting for us?

01:22:35.582 --> 01:22:36.708
Just us.

01:22:37.375 --> 01:22:40.795
But there will be many people
happy to hear you two are alive.

01:22:40.796 --> 01:22:41.879
Once I radio back.

01:22:41.880 --> 01:22:44.215
You'll be back in your own bed
in no time.

01:22:44.925 --> 01:22:46.885
There's a shortcut
just ahead here.

01:22:57.228 --> 01:22:59.980
I bet you can't wait
to return to your life.

01:22:59.981 --> 01:23:03.525
Your job, your family,
your friends.

01:23:28.384 --> 01:23:30.596
Uh, shoelace.

01:23:31.471 --> 01:23:32.430
Okay.

01:23:32.764 --> 01:23:35.641
- Just follow the trail.
- Yeah.

01:23:35.642 --> 01:23:37.227
I'm right behind you.

01:23:58.749 --> 01:24:00.708
Zuri! Zuri! Zuri! Come on!

01:24:00.709 --> 01:24:03.669
Grab my hand. Hey. Come on!

01:24:03.670 --> 01:24:06.255
I got you. I got you.
You can do it. You can do it.

01:24:06.256 --> 01:24:07.965
Help me! Help me!

01:24:07.966 --> 01:24:09.717
Come on. Come on.

01:24:09.718 --> 01:24:11.051
I got you!

01:24:11.052 --> 01:24:12.344
- Zuri! Come on.
- Linda, help us!

01:24:12.345 --> 01:24:14.429
I got you. You can do it.
You can do it.

01:24:14.430 --> 01:24:16.098
I got you. You can do it.

01:24:17.768 --> 01:24:19.143
Help me!

01:24:19.144 --> 01:24:20.395
- Linda!
- Linda!

01:24:20.854 --> 01:24:22.229
Help us!

01:24:22.230 --> 01:24:24.983
Linda!

01:24:36.494 --> 01:24:37.704
Dinner.

01:24:39.164 --> 01:24:40.165
Yep.

01:25:31.842 --> 01:25:34.177
Saw some fresh boar tracks
earlier today.

01:25:35.511 --> 01:25:37.180
We haven't had protein
in awhile.

01:25:38.724 --> 01:25:40.726
Maybe when it clears up
we should go hunting.

01:25:44.520 --> 01:25:46.147
I'm taking a sick day.

01:25:49.359 --> 01:25:50.777
Can't do it on my own.

01:26:33.779 --> 01:26:35.822
Linda!

01:27:42.097 --> 01:27:43.640
Linda.

01:27:45.016 --> 01:27:47.102
Linda!

01:27:48.478 --> 01:27:50.896
You tried to kill me.

01:27:50.897 --> 01:27:52.733
- No.
- Why?

01:27:53.734 --> 01:27:54.943
Why?

01:27:55.611 --> 01:27:57.153
Why'd you do it?

01:27:58.780 --> 01:28:02.324
Why?

01:28:02.325 --> 01:28:04.326
Why'd you have to come?

01:28:04.327 --> 01:28:05.620
I'm gonna tell Bradley
everything.

01:28:05.621 --> 01:28:06.536
No.

01:28:06.537 --> 01:28:08.080
- You're a murderer.
- No.

01:28:08.081 --> 01:28:09.456
You are!

01:28:58.506 --> 01:29:01.509
Fuck!

01:30:13.957 --> 01:30:15.416
Where you been?

01:30:17.794 --> 01:30:18.962
Nowhere.

01:30:21.256 --> 01:30:23.299
Take another sick day?

01:30:28.096 --> 01:30:29.389
What is it?

01:30:32.684 --> 01:30:33.977
You know what's happening.

01:30:35.061 --> 01:30:36.520
No, I don't actually.

01:30:36.521 --> 01:30:37.689
You don't?

01:30:38.523 --> 01:30:40.691
I don't. I don't actually.

01:30:40.692 --> 01:30:42.068
Did you kill her?

01:30:46.489 --> 01:30:47.407
Who?

01:30:56.958 --> 01:30:58.084
She slipped.

01:30:59.335 --> 01:31:02.296
I was trying to bring her to you
and she got ahead--

01:31:02.297 --> 01:31:03.297
Why didn't you tell me?

01:31:03.298 --> 01:31:04.464
Because I knew
how it would look...

01:31:04.465 --> 01:31:06.008
Why wouldn't you tell me
she came here?

01:31:06.009 --> 01:31:07.093
...and I knew you wouldn't
believe me!

01:31:07.594 --> 01:31:09.136
You wouldn't believe me!

01:31:09.137 --> 01:31:11.640
You're right, I don't.

01:31:12.265 --> 01:31:13.516
I don't believe you.

01:31:17.437 --> 01:31:19.564
It was an accident.

01:31:19.565 --> 01:31:22.150
I swear to you.

01:31:22.943 --> 01:31:25.278
Just like your husband's
death was an accident?

01:33:00.498 --> 01:33:03.752
You motherfucker!

01:33:17.140 --> 01:33:18.348
Oh, fuck!

01:33:18.349 --> 01:33:19.725
What the fuck?

01:34:06.940 --> 01:34:09.191
Fuck you, Bradley!

01:34:29.379 --> 01:34:31.297
Oh!

01:34:35.051 --> 01:34:36.302
Where'd you go?

01:35:25.811 --> 01:35:29.898
Hey. Hey!

01:35:31.107 --> 01:35:32.024
Hey!

01:35:34.277 --> 01:35:37.197
Hey!

01:35:46.665 --> 01:35:49.084
Hey!

01:36:14.776 --> 01:36:17.195
What the fuck?

01:36:23.409 --> 01:36:25.953
Oh, is there anything
more civilized

01:36:25.954 --> 01:36:27.288
than refrigeration?

01:36:29.457 --> 01:36:31.041
There's a frozen
Massaman curry in there

01:36:31.042 --> 01:36:32.417
that's to die for.

01:36:36.256 --> 01:36:37.799
You looking for a knife?

01:36:38.550 --> 01:36:41.553
Yeah. I got rid of all of those.

01:36:42.679 --> 01:36:44.097
Except for one.

01:36:45.932 --> 01:36:46.808
Hey, pal.

01:36:48.309 --> 01:36:50.895
So tell me, Bradley,

01:36:50.896 --> 01:36:54.356
how does a knife
just wash up on shore?

01:36:55.901 --> 01:36:58.027
You really crack me up
sometimes.

01:37:01.447 --> 01:37:03.575
Where you going? Where
you going? Where you going?

01:37:04.492 --> 01:37:05.450
Oh, there you are.

01:37:06.703 --> 01:37:08.371
Nice place, huh?

01:37:09.122 --> 01:37:11.457
Owner is some
Wall Street billionaire.

01:37:12.375 --> 01:37:14.628
First thing I did
was turn off the security.

01:37:15.170 --> 01:37:17.505
Guy didn't even notice.

01:37:18.590 --> 01:37:21.593
Bradley, I have a confession to
make and I feel sick about it.

01:37:23.219 --> 01:37:25.055
Sorry to tell you this, but...

01:37:25.764 --> 01:37:28.016
we could've been rescued
some time ago.

01:37:30.811 --> 01:37:32.938
But I wasn't ready to leave yet.

01:37:35.857 --> 01:37:38.234
I just needed
a little more time.

01:38:01.675 --> 01:38:03.677
After the caretakers left...

01:38:04.510 --> 01:38:05.929
I broke in.

01:38:07.388 --> 01:38:09.265
It was easy.

01:38:39.420 --> 01:38:42.882
And then you and me,
we were alone again.

01:38:44.593 --> 01:38:47.095
It was... perfect.

01:38:47.804 --> 01:38:49.264
What the fuck.

01:38:50.181 --> 01:38:52.559
Just me and my new Sweetie.

01:38:54.728 --> 01:38:58.774
Well, for a little while.

01:38:59.650 --> 01:39:01.526
Things just kept happening.

01:39:03.194 --> 01:39:04.738
It's not like I planned it.

01:39:06.657 --> 01:39:07.866
I swear to you.

01:39:08.950 --> 01:39:10.325
I didn't want any of this.

01:39:10.326 --> 01:39:11.369
Linda!

01:39:12.913 --> 01:39:15.999
Come on, girl!
You can do it, I got you!

01:39:16.750 --> 01:39:19.961
Zuri! Zuri! I got you!
You can do it! You can do it!

01:39:20.712 --> 01:39:22.755
I got you!

01:39:22.756 --> 01:39:26.967
Linda!

01:39:38.730 --> 01:39:39.815
Bradley?

01:39:41.650 --> 01:39:46.446
Don't you wonder why we were
the only ones who made it?

01:39:50.867 --> 01:39:54.245
Maybe it was written
in the stars.

01:40:20.814 --> 01:40:22.774
I'm sorry it had to be this way.

01:40:24.484 --> 01:40:26.151
Because it could've been
so good.

01:40:26.152 --> 01:40:28.863
Wait, wait, please,
please, please. You were right.

01:40:28.864 --> 01:40:30.280
You were right.
You were right, okay?

01:40:30.281 --> 01:40:32.199
I was-- I was a piece of shit.

01:40:32.200 --> 01:40:34.409
- I was a terrible person.
- Uh-huh.

01:40:34.410 --> 01:40:35.911
I was, uh...

01:40:35.912 --> 01:40:39.207
I was a monster.
I was.

01:40:40.083 --> 01:40:43.962
I was a monster!

01:40:46.757 --> 01:40:50.176
The way I treated everyone.

01:40:51.970 --> 01:40:54.890
I'm so broken.

01:40:55.891 --> 01:40:57.267
You broke me.

01:41:01.146 --> 01:41:02.648
I've changed.

01:41:04.190 --> 01:41:09.862
Really, I have. I can feel it.

01:41:09.863 --> 01:41:13.491
Because of you. Because I... I--

01:41:15.076 --> 01:41:16.202
Linda...

01:41:18.496 --> 01:41:20.122
I think you're
the most incredible person

01:41:20.123 --> 01:41:21.249
I've ever known.

01:41:23.960 --> 01:41:25.336
You took care of me.

01:41:26.462 --> 01:41:27.838
I tried.

01:41:27.839 --> 01:41:30.508
You did.
And you taught me things.

01:41:32.761 --> 01:41:35.305
No one's ever taken the time
to teach me anything.

01:41:43.689 --> 01:41:45.106
You saved me.

01:41:49.027 --> 01:41:52.197
I felt love from you in a way
that I've never...

01:41:52.823 --> 01:41:54.783
felt from anyone.

01:42:01.122 --> 01:42:02.999
I think we can make this work.

01:42:04.626 --> 01:42:07.045
- What?
- Here.

01:42:09.673 --> 01:42:11.340
No, you don't.

01:42:11.341 --> 01:42:14.052
Yeah. You were right.
We can stay.

01:42:15.303 --> 01:42:17.639
You proved it yourself
we can survive.

01:42:18.557 --> 01:42:20.183
We have everything we need.

01:42:21.351 --> 01:42:22.185
Yeah.

01:42:23.311 --> 01:42:24.979
That's what I've been saying.

01:42:24.980 --> 01:42:26.147
I know.

01:42:27.398 --> 01:42:29.484
There's nothing for us
back there.

01:42:31.570 --> 01:42:33.613
I want to be happy.

01:42:33.614 --> 01:42:35.156
With you, here.

01:42:36.783 --> 01:42:38.785
Just us, you and me.

01:42:44.332 --> 01:42:45.709
I see it now.

01:42:49.880 --> 01:42:51.381
Actually happy?

01:42:52.298 --> 01:42:53.465
Not some bullshit?

01:42:53.466 --> 01:42:55.343
Not some fucking bullshit.

01:42:56.970 --> 01:42:58.428
You want to go back
to that life?

01:42:58.429 --> 01:42:59.765
No fucking way.

01:43:00.098 --> 01:43:02.057
